      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-10-01T09:53:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, Plague Rat was one of the first villains I played with her, and it was indeed silly amounts of fun. Afflicted Frenzy? Fanatic just turns around and chews on Plague Rat. Self-damage? Hang on, lemme chew on Plague Rat some more.</p><p>Sacrosanct Martyr has gone from \"never use except it's useful with PW Fanatic sometimes\" to \"nuke people for 5 damage don't mind if I do\".</p><p>Divine Focus gets more fun too; I rarely ever want to keep it around longer anyway so now I get an extra bit of 4 damage out of it.</p>",
