      "created_at": "2017-10-01T20:12:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Add in <strong>having Writhe hit you with Blackout</strong> or Scholar playing Proverbs and Axioms</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>O_O</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Oh wow</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I think the one part of her (with no outside help) that is a little disappointing is Embolden. Since, if you don't deal the damage to the hero target, it is destroyed, so you can't keep up the Kill the Spirit Shengagins and give Fanatic a second power in most circumstances.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Which is fine, but a little disappointing</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
